     6	    Note: if there are several items with similar sum of their digits,
     7	    order them based on their index in original list.
     8	
     9	    For example:
    10	    >>> order_by_points([1, 11, -1, -11, -12]) == [-1, -11, 1, -12, 11]
    11	    >>> order_by_points([]) == []
    12	    """
