codex
The root cause is now concrete: Lean 4.22 calls `readlink("/proc/<getpid>/exe")`; in this container the PID namespace and mounted `/proc` disagree, so that numeric path returns `ENOENT`, while `/proc/self/exe` works. I’m applying a narrow local interposer that maps only `/proc/<digits>/exe` to `/proc/self/exe`, then rerunning the unchanged trusted preflight.
apply patch
